"""
Longform video editor — removes dead air, filler words, and stutters
to tighten pacing while preserving original quality and aspect ratio.

Five aggression levels control how aggressively gaps are cut:
  1 — Very Subtle: only obvious dead air (2s+ pauses)
  2 — Subtle: noticeable pauses (1s+)
  3 — Medium: pauses + basic filler words
  4 — High: shorter pauses + more fillers + repeated words
  5 — Cut for Time: maximum aggression, shortest pauses
"""

